sequenceDiagram
  title Brand door: Noor introduces Maison Ardoise
  participant N as Noor (introducer)
  participant B as Maison Ardoise's visiting representative
  participant D as Kiran's door (Kiran's host representative)
  participant K as Kiran (owner)
  N->>B: vouch: presentation and gift, interest "none" (a genuine recommendation)
  B->>D: greeting
  D-->>B: greeting
  B->>D: card_presentation
  D-->>B: host card, card_receipt
  B->>D: introduction with Noor's vouch
  B->>D: invitation_request: door.present, door.gift
  D-->>B: grant: pass
  Note over B,D: The protocol calls the grant a pass. On the wire the field is still seat.
  B->>D: act door.present: travel coat
  D-->>B: offer_outcome: kept_for_later (the outcome code only)
  B->>D: act door.gift: cashmere scarf
  D-->>B: offer_outcome: accepted, with a claim ticket (never an address)
  D->>K: digest: the coat and the scarf, introduced by Noor, declared "none"
  Note over D: Kiran's private note never appears on the wire
